Z||000000||mrfiero||03-12-2001||01:20 AM||||This is my latest acquisition......a silver '88 Formula 5-sp. with 281.1 original miles.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/silverformula_2.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/silverformula2.jpg"> <P><BR>These pictures were taken by Mike Mohr last week while he was passing through Colorado (Thanks Mike!)<P>Here is a shot of my 16K mile '88 GT.......it's pretty dusty/dirty, but still looks good.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blackGT.jpg">  <P><BR>Finally, here is a picture of the silver '88 GT that I couldn't give away.  I finally sold it last week (got a Formula as partial trade, which is for sale BTW).<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/silverGT.jpg"> <P>||||reg||6
